---
import PageGridIllustration from './PageGridIllustration.astro';
import LandingHero from './LandingHero.astro';
import LayerDiagram from './LayerDiagram.astro';
import LayerBricks from './LayerBricks.astro';

const example = `<link rel="stylesheet"
  href="/my-styles.css" />

<h1>Welcome</h1>
<p>Make yourself at home</p>
<button>Get started</button>`;
---

<article class="landing" aria-labelledby="landing-title" data-pagefind-body>
  <LandingHero />
  <section id="learn-more" class="landing-layers" aria-labelledby="what-title">
    <div class="landing-content">
      <h2 id="what-title">What Design system 1 is</h2>
      <p>A system of Web Components. They are ordinary HTML elements, so they work everywhere your browser works: in plain pages and inside any framework, with nothing to compile.</p>
      <p>One stylesheet and one script bring the whole system. Every size in it comes from a single unit, so spacing, type and layout stay in proportion on every screen.</p>
      <h2 id="layers-title" class="landing-layers-title">Four layers, one unit</h2>
      <p>Root sets the unit. Core components are single pieces sized by it. Units put those pieces together, and pages place the units on the grid.</p>
    </div>
    <LayerBricks />
    <LayerDiagram />
    <a href="/components/">All components <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </section>
  <div class="landing-layout">
  <div class="landing-content">
    <section class="landing-section landing-section--first" aria-labelledby="concept-title">
      <h2 id="concept-title">A shared foundation</h2>
      <p>Start with a square. Use it to size a button, place a heading, or give a panel room to breathe.</p>
      <p>The grid adapts to the screen. On mobile, the squares scale while the column count stays consistent. The elements follow the same scale.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="landing-section" aria-labelledby="grid-demo-title">
      <h2 id="grid-demo-title">Everything lines up</h2>
      <p>The pastel areas show how a page takes shape. Its title, header, body, and navigation each occupy a place on the same grid.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="landing-section" aria-labelledby="classless-title">
      <h2 id="classless-title">Your design, ordinary HTML</h2>
      <p>CLASSless brings the design to native HTML. Headings, buttons, and forms take their appearance from a shared stylesheet.</p>
      <p>Adjust the elements in the editor, then copy the CSS into your project. You can try it without an account.</p>
      <pre aria-label="HTML with a custom stylesheet"><code>{example}</code></pre>
      <p>Link your stylesheet and write your page. The playground is temporary, so copy your CSS to keep it.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="landing-section" aria-labelledby="components-title">
      <h2 id="components-title">Components when you need them</h2>
      <p>For interactive controls, use the Web Components with their stylesheet and JavaScript bundle. Themes, translations, and preferences are part of the system too.</p>
      <a href="/components/">Explore the components <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </section>

    <nav class="landing-footer" aria-label="Explore Design system 1">
      <a href="/classless/editor/">Editor <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a href="/components/">Components <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <a href="/getting-started/installation/">Documentation <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </nav>
  </div>
  <PageGridIllustration />
  </div>
</article>



<style>
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Inter Arrows';
    src: url('/fonts/InterArrows.woff2') format('woff2');
    font-weight: 100 900;
    font-style: normal;
    font-display: swap;
    unicode-range: U+2190-21FF, U+2794-27FF, U+2900-297F, U+2B00-2BFF, U+1F800-1F8FF;
  }

  .landing {
    --landing-unit: min(calc(var(--unit, 20px) * var(--sf, 1)), calc(100vw / 57));
    --landing-content-width: calc(12 * var(--landing-unit));
    --landing-type: calc(0.7 * var(--landing-unit));
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: none;
    min-height: 100vh;
    min-height: 100dvh;
    margin: 0;
    padding-block: 0 calc(4 * var(--landing-unit));
    color: var(--ds1-docs-header-text);
  }

  .landing-layout {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: var(--landing-content-width) calc(32 * var(--landing-unit));
    gap: calc(7 * var(--landing-unit));
    width: max-content;
    margin-inline-start: calc(5 * var(--landing-unit));
    margin-inline-end: auto;
    align-items: start;
  }

  /* Keep the compact text column beside the portfolio layout illustration. */
  .landing-content {
    width: var(--landing-content-width);
    font-family: var(--typeface-regular);
    font-size: var(--landing-type);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: var(--landing-unit);
  }

  .landing :is(h1, h2, p, pre) { margin: 0; }
  .landing :is(h1, h2) {
    color: inherit;
    font-family: var(--typeface-regular);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    line-height: var(--landing-unit);
  }
  .landing h2 { font-size: var(--landing-type); font-family: var(--typeface-medium); }
  .landing p { font-size: var(--landing-type); line-height: var(--landing-unit); }
  .landing :is(p + p, h2 + p) { margin-top: var(--landing-unit); }
  .landing-section { margin-top: calc(3 * var(--landing-unit)); }
  .landing-section--first { margin-top: 0; }
  .landing .landing-layers-title { margin-top: calc(2 * var(--landing-unit)); }
  .landing-layers {
    display: grid;
    gap: calc(2 * var(--landing-unit));
    justify-items: start;
    margin-inline-start: calc(5 * var(--landing-unit));
    padding-block: calc(4 * var(--landing-unit));
    scroll-margin-top: 0;
  }

  .landing a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: calc(0.25 * var(--landing-unit));
    max-width: 100%;
    color: inherit;
    font-size: var(--landing-type);
    line-height: var(--landing-unit);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .landing a > span[aria-hidden='true'] {
    font-family: 'Inter Arrows', Inter, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 1em;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .landing a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .landing :is(a, button):focus-visible { outline: 2px solid currentColor; outline-offset: 3px; }
  .landing-actions, .landing-footer { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: var(--landing-unit); margin-top: var(--landing-unit); }
  .landing-footer { margin-top: calc(3 * var(--landing-unit)); }
  .landing .landing-button {
    width: auto;
    padding: 0 calc(0.1 * var(--landing-unit));
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 0;
    background: var(--button-background-color-secondary);
    color: var(--button-text-color-secondary, var(--black));
    font-family: var(--typeface-regular);
    font-size: var(--landing-type);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: var(--landing-unit);
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .landing-section > a { margin-top: var(--landing-unit); }

  .landing pre {
    margin-block: var(--landing-unit);
    overflow-x: auto;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    background: var(--ds1-docs-content-bg);
    line-height: var(--landing-unit);
  }
  .landing code { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Consolas, monospace; font-size: var(--landing-type); color: inherit; }

  @media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .landing {
      --landing-unit: min(calc(var(--unit, 20px) * var(--sf, 1)), calc(100vw / 39));
    }
    .landing-layout { grid-template-columns: var(--landing-content-width) calc(16 * var(--landing-unit)); gap: calc(5 * var(--landing-unit)); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .landing {
      --landing-unit: min(calc(var(--unit, 20px) * var(--sf, 1)), calc(100vw / 21));
    }
    .landing-layout { grid-template-columns: var(--landing-content-width); gap: calc(3 * var(--landing-unit)); }
  }
  :global(html.mobile) .landing {
    --landing-unit: min(calc(var(--unit, 20px) * var(--sf, 1)), calc(100vw / 21));
  }
  :global(html.mobile) .landing-layout {
    grid-template-columns: var(--landing-content-width);
    gap: calc(3 * var(--landing-unit));
  }
</style>
